{
  "id": "fog-of-war",
  "code": "B-03",
  "kind": "addon",
  "name": "Fog of war",
  "family": "map-visibility",
  "oneLiner": "On a tile map, everything outside your units' sight sinks under a slowly drifting, dithered fog with a soft one-tile edge; terrain stays faintly readable, hidden enemies are not drawn, the tile where you last saw one keeps a faint silhouette, a \"!\" pops when one comes into view, forests block sight and hills extend it, and tiles clear or fog over smoothly as units move.",
  "fits": [
    "tactics / strategy RPG",
    "turn-based wargame",
    "top-down tile adventure or dungeon crawler",
    "roguelike (grid)",
    "real-time tile strategy"
  ],
  "notFor": [
    "side-view games without a tile map",
    "games where hidden information would be unfair to a human opponent on the same screen (hot-seat) without a handover screen",
    "huge maps with thousands of units (recomputes every step; fine up to ~100 units)"
  ],
  "interfaces": {
    "time": "turn",
    "coords": "grid",
    "layer": "post",
    "needs": [
      "tile grid size and tile size in px",
      "unit list with each unit's drawn tile and side",
      "optional: terrain callbacks (blocks sight, vision bonus)",
      "camera offset (map scroll in px)",
      "a fixed-step update (60 Hz) and a draw pass between ground and units",
      "optional: rectangles to avoid (HUD, banners, windows)"
    ],
    "provides": [
      "data isVisible(x, y) and isUnitVisible(unit) for drawing (and, if the game chooses, rules)",
      "event reveal {unit, x, y} when an enemy comes into sight",
      "data last-seen ghosts [{x, y, unit}] and explored tiles"
    ]
  },
  "params": [
    {
      "key": "radius",
      "label": "Base vision (tiles)",
      "type": "range",
      "min": 1,
      "max": 8,
      "step": 1,
      "default": 3
    },
    {
      "key": "shape",
      "label": "Vision shape",
      "type": "select",
      "options": [
        "diamond",
        "circle",
        "square"
      ],
      "default": "diamond"
    },
    {
      "key": "density",
      "label": "Fog density",
      "type": "range",
      "min": 0.3,
      "max": 0.85,
      "step": 0.05,
      "default": 0.6
    },
    {
      "key": "edge",
      "label": "Soft edge (tiles)",
      "type": "range",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 1.5,
      "step": 0.25,
      "default": 1
    },
    {
      "key": "drift",
      "label": "Mist drift (px/s)",
      "type": "range",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 20,
      "step": 1,
      "default": 6
    },
    {
      "key": "fade",
      "label": "Reveal fade (ms)",
      "type": "range",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 600,
      "step": 20,
      "default": 240
    },
    {
      "key": "ghosts",
      "label": "Last-seen silhouettes",
      "type": "select",
      "options": [
        "on",
        "off"
      ],
      "default": "on"
    },
    {
      "key": "pop",
      "label": "\"!\" on reveal",
      "type": "select",
      "options": [
        "on",
        "off"
      ],
      "default": "on"
    },
    {
      "key": "shroud",
      "label": "Unexplored darker",
      "type": "select",
      "options": [
        "off",
        "on"
      ],
      "default": "off"
    },
    {
      "key": "scheme",
      "label": "Fog colour",
      "type": "select",
      "options": [
        "night",
        "mist",
        "ash"
      ],
      "default": "night"
    }
  ],
  "variants": [
    {
      "name": "Classic 16-bit",
      "params": {
        "density": 0.6,
        "edge": 1,
        "drift": 6,
        "fade": 240,
        "scheme": "night",
        "shroud": "off"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Unexplored shroud",
      "params": {
        "density": 0.75,
        "edge": 0.5,
        "drift": 3,
        "fade": 160,
        "scheme": "night",
        "shroud": "on"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Morning mist",
      "params": {
        "density": 0.5,
        "edge": 1.5,
        "drift": 12,
        "fade": 400,
        "scheme": "mist"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Battle smoke",
      "params": {
        "density": 0.7,
        "edge": 0.75,
        "drift": 8,
        "fade": 240,
        "scheme": "ash"
      }
    }
  ],
  "assets": [
    "module/fog-of-war.js: the element as one dependency-free script (global GameDNA_FogOfWar): line-of-sight vision, fog raster (Bayer dither, value-noise mist, desaturation pass), silhouettes, \"!\" bubble",
    "no image or audio files"
  ],
  "status": "draft",
  "module": {
    "file": "module/fog-of-war.js",
    "global": "GameDNA_FogOfWar",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "docs": "module/README.md"
  }
}
